OL,3,GNEWSAMan proud to discover memorial for
OL,4,Agreat-uncle killed in WW1
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has told of his pride at
OL,7,Fdiscovering a memorial dedicated to his
OL,8,Fgreat-uncle and five other gas workers
OL,9,Fkilled in World War One.
OL,11,FPte Samuel Corfe, James Hitchmough, Pte
OL,12,FRichard Ireland, L/Cpl Alexander
OL,13,FMcDonnell, stoker Allan Prophet and Pte
OL,14,FJohn Williams worked at the gasworks in
OL,15,FGarston, Liverpool.
OL,17,FGeorge Corfe found about the memorial
OL,18,Fafter gas network company Cadent put
OL,19,Fout a plea to relatives to make sure
OL,20,Fthey were aware of it.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
